---
import '../../styles/v3-pages.css';
import V3CommercialHeader from '../../components/V3CommercialHeader.astro';
import V3CommercialFooter from '../../components/V3CommercialFooter.astro';
import V3Seo from '../../components/V3Seo.astro';
import { v3SocialAdaptations } from '../../data/v3-blog';
import { v3DailySocialAdaptations } from '../../data/v3-daily-social';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const adaptations=[...v3DailySocialAdaptations,...v3SocialAdaptations];
const selected=adaptations[0];
const channelLabel={linkedin:'LinkedIn',instagram:'Instagram',facebook:'Facebook'} as const;
const previewCaption=(value:string)=>value.length>320?`${value.slice(0,320).trim()}…`:value;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><V3Seo title="Cola social V4 · IsiVoltPro" description="Preview no indexada del flujo social de IsiVoltPro: adaptación por canal, revisión humana y futura publicación mediante proveedores oficiales." path={`${base}preview-v4/social/`} noindex={true}/><style is:inline>
.hero{padding:72px 0 54px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 82% 12%,#6d4aff24,transparent 28%),#fff}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}.hero h1{margin:18px 0;font:800 clamp(50px,5.7vw,78px)/.98 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.062em}.hero p,.step p{color:#6e7a90;line-height:1.65}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}.state,.queue,.pipeline{display:grid;gap:12px}.state{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.state article,.channel,.step{padding:20px;border:1px solid #e5e9f2;border-radius:20px;background:#fff}.state small{color:#7a86a0;font-size:9px;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase}.state strong{display:block;margin-top:7px}.state p,.step p{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:11px}.queue{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.channel{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.channel-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-weight:900}.status{padding:5px 7px;border-radius:999px;background:#f2efff;color:#624cd8;font-size:9px}.caption{margin:18px 0;white-space:pre-line;color:#566277;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.channel img{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px}.channel small{margin-top:7px;color:#8a95a6;font-size:9px}.pipeline{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}.step b{color:#6752db;font-size:10px}.step strong{display:block;margin-top:7px}.guard{padding:28px;border-radius:26px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0d1730,#342676);color:#fff}.guard h2{margin:0 0 8px}.guard p{margin:0;color:#c9d3e7;line-height:1.65}@media(max-width:980px){.hero-grid,.queue{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pipeline{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:620px){.hero{padding:52px 0 42px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,12vw,58px)}.state,.pipeline{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><V3CommercialHeader/><main class="page-main"><section class="hero"><div class="page-shell hero-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Fase 10D.1 · Cola social</span><h1>Una noticia.<br/><span class="gradient-text">Tres voces, una sola fuente.</span></h1><p>Preparamos texto, imagen y revisión por canal. Todavía no conectamos cuentas ni publicamos automáticamente.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href={`${base}preview-v4/blog/`}>Revisar Blog V4 →</a><a class="btn" href={`${base}preview-v4/fase-10/`}>Ver Fase 10</a></div></div><div class="state"><article><small>Automático</small><strong>Desactivado</strong><p>La fase termina en revisión.</p></article><article><small>Proveedores</small><strong>Por conectar</strong><p>Sin tokens en frontend.</p></article><article><small>Canales</small><strong>3 adaptaciones</strong><p>LinkedIn, Instagram y Facebook.</p></article><article><small>Confirmación</small><strong>Obligatoria</strong><p>Programado ≠ publicado.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="page-section page-section--soft"><div class="page-shell"><div class="page-section__head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Ejemplo actual</span><h2>El mensaje cambia<br/><span class="gradient-text">según el canal.</span></h2></div><p>Vista resumida. La cola interna conserva el copy completo.</p></div>{selected&&<div class="queue">{selected.channels.map((channel)=><article class="channel"><div class="channel-top"><span>{channelLabel[channel]}</span><span class="status">{selected.status}</span></div><div class="caption">{previewCaption(selected.captions[channel])}</div><img src={`${base}${selected.media.replace(/^\/+/, '')}`} alt="Recurso visual preparado para una adaptación social de IsiVoltPro" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy"/><small>Medio editorial · revisión obligatoria</small></article>)}</div>}</div></section><section class="page-section"><div class="page-shell"><div class="pipeline"><article class="step"><b>01</b><strong>Artículo aprobado</strong><p>Fuente y contenido pasan 10C.</p></article><article class="step"><b>02</b><strong>Adaptar</strong><p>Copy distinto por red.</p></article><article class="step"><b>03</b><strong>Revisar</strong><p>Texto, imagen y horario.</p></article><article class="step"><b>04</b><strong>Proveedor</strong><p>Credenciales solo en backend.</p></article><article class="step"><b>05</b><strong>Confirmar</strong><p>La API confirma `published`.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="page-section page-section--soft"><div class="page-shell"><aside class="guard"><h2>La cola no es una publicación.</h2><p>10D.1 no necesita credenciales. Un futuro worker solo podrá marcar `published` después de recibir confirmación real del proveedor oficial.</p></aside></div></section></main><V3CommercialFooter/></body></html>